# Pairs with DeleteNeverMidCutover. The restore builds its shadow without
# taking the alias reservation, so the tree can be deleted under it.
MODULE: DeleteNeverMidCutoverBuildUnreserved
TARGET: DeleteNeverMidCutover
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the shadow build takes no alias reservation
PERTURBS: Build

--- FIND
    /\ reserved' = TRUE
    /\ rp' = "built"
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: no reservation.
    /\ reserved' = FALSE
    /\ rp' = "built"
--- END
